# FateNavi scope

- Default scope is **FateNavi3** (`theme: "hanji"`, `app/FateNavi3/**`).
- Do **not** change FateNavi2 or FateNavi4 (`/FateNavi2`, `/FateNavi4`, sheep/premium) unless the user explicitly asks.
- Shared routes under `/FateNavi` (checkout, report, legal, admin, API) are common infrastructure — keep them; version-1 theme UI is removed.
- Shared components (`NewYearForm`, `NewYearResultScreen`, etc.): prefer `theme === "hanji"` branching or FateNavi3-specific files over editing 2/4 pages.
- When the user says to update 2 or 4, only then touch those routes/themes.
